{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RUQVRljvEd1795663844.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段片長約9秒的短片，記錄了屯門某商場一間連鎖快餐店驚現鼠蹤的駭人場面。根據流傳片段及現場聲音顯示，事發時一隻老鼠正在該連鎖快餐店上方的牆壁上爬行，隨即引起在場食客一陣騷動。有食客目睹老鼠現身後不禁驚呼：「嘩，好大隻」，期間更有女食客大感驚慌，連聲說道：「死啦，走過嚟啦，走過嚟啦！」。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-26-11h23m21s202.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026T1O0H902j01795663808.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-26-11h23m24s943.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261QO7nhaPPG1795663801.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>短片上載至社交平台後迅速掀起熱烈討論，大批網民看後直呼畫面可怕，並對該隻老鼠的體型感到震驚，紛紛留言表示：「嚇死人咩」、「咁大隻！」及「驚驚」。此外，亦有網民指出該商場附近一帶鼠患嚴重，呼籲盡快向食環署舉報以跟進處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:20:21.264812+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T03:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T00:17:15.983473+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T04:13:45.584202+00:00","content_hash":"7920e8dd9f08d0c0adb3ba5cfd0eabce9b21c166450e9cf735ff4e6d861b61d5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:20:21.264812+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}